<!doctype html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/app.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="brand">
          <div class="brand-dot"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="h1">Chat Factions</div>
            <div class="muted">Page not found</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid two">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-title">
            <h2>404</h2>
            <div class="hint">Not found</div>
          </div>

          <p class="notice">
            That page doesn’t exist (or it was moved). If you followed a saved overlay URL, double-check the path.
          </p>

          <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:12px;">
            <a class="btn" href="/">Go Home</a>
            <a class="btn secondary" href="/admin">Streamer Dashboard</a>
          </div>

          <div class="small muted" style="margin-top:12px;">
            Tip: If you’re setting up OBS, make sure you copied the full overlay URL exactly as shown in your dashboard.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-title">
            <h2>Common fixes</h2>
            <div class="hint">Quick checks</div>
          </div>

          <ul class="small" style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px;">
            <li>Remove extra spaces from the URL.</li>
            <li>Make sure you’re on the correct streamer account.</li>
            <li>If you upgraded recently, refresh the dashboard and try again.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
